# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/sphereeversion.xml.h:43
msgid ""
"\n"
"Turns a sphere inside out: a smooth deformation (homotopy).  During the\n"
"eversion, the deformed sphere is allowed to intersect itself transversally,\n"
"however, no creases or pinch points occur.\n"
"\n"
"Inspired by the following paper: Adam Bednorz, Witold Bednorz:\n"
"\"Analytic sphere eversion using ruled surfaces\", Differential Geometry\n"
"and its Applications 64:59-79, 2019.\n"
"\n"
"Also by the video \"Outside In\" by The Geometry Center (Bill Thurston, "
"Silvio\n"
"Levy, Delle Maxwell, Tamara Munzner, Nathaniel Thurston, David Ben-Zvi, "
"Matt\n"
"Headrick, et al.), 1994, and the accompanying booklet Silvio Levy: \"Making\n"
"Waves — A Guide to the Ideas Behind Outside In\", A K Peters, Wellesley, "
"MA,\n"
"1995.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sphere_eversion\n"
"\n"
"Written by Carsten Steger; 2020.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Γυρίζει μια σφαίρα μέσα προς τα έξω: μια ομαλή παραμόρφωση (ομοτοπία).  Κατά "
"τη διάρκεια του\n"
"εκτροπής, η παραμορφωμένη σφαίρα επιτρέπεται να τέμνεται εγκάρσια,\n"
"Ωστόσο, δεν εμφανίζονται τσακίσεις ή σημεία τσιμπήματος.\n"
"\n"
"Εμπνευσμένο από την ακόλουθη εργασία: Adam Bednorz, Witold Bednorz:\n"
"«Αναλυτική εκτροπή σφαίρας με χρήση κυβερνημένων επιφανειών», Διαφορική "
"Γεωμετρία\n"
"and its Applications 64:59-79, 2019.\n"
"\n"
"1995.Επίσης από το βίντεο \"Outside In\" από το The Geometry Center (Bill "
"Thurston, Silvio\n"
"Levy, Delle Maxwell, Tamara Munzner, Nathaniel Thurston, David Ben-Zvi, "
"Matt\n"
"Headrick, et al.), 1994, και το συνοδευτικό φυλλάδιο Silvio Levy: \"Making\n"
"Waves — A Guide to the Ideas Behind Outside In», A K Peters, Wellesley, MA,\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sphere_eversion\n"
"\n"
"Γράφτηκε από τον Carsten Steger. 2020.\n"
"  "

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/spheremonics.xml.h:1
msgid "Spheremonics"
msgstr "Σφαιρομονικά"

# (auto-translated)
